+and future live entry have NOT been certified. Profile transport is now
+explicitly fail-closed both at the bridge and direct worker CLI. No four-task
+run, real model/provider, official Task experiment, official evaluator,
+training, or scoring-model call was made. The tests execute fake Python tools
+and a synthetic HTTP *mock* at requests.post; they do not run Docker tools.
+
+IDENTITY AND SCOPE
+Repository: E:/longcontext-cqs-v0-20261005, branch crs-v0-20261007,
+initial HEAD fc0a1e5a4febd8166d60ab538152d964f4d19e08. The public PoS
